msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດລັອກແບບແຈ້ງນີ້ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມີແບບແຈ້ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ທີ່ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າການລົງບັນຊີຢູ່."

#. module: account_reports
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_reports/models/account_return.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot reset this closing entry to draft, as it would delete carryover "
